const ellipse=[
 E('foundation','axis-reading','Identify the major axis, foci and eccentricity.｜辨認長軸、焦點及離心率。','§frac{x^2}{25}+§frac{y^2}{9}=1',null,['Compare the denominators.｜比較分母。','The focal square is their positive difference.｜焦距平方為其正差。'],[['The major semiaxis is 5 along x; the minor is 3.｜長半軸沿x，長5；短半軸長3。','c^2=25-9=16'],['Locate the symmetric foci and divide c by a.｜定位對稱焦點，並以c除以a。','F=(§pm4,0),§ e=4/5']],'Horizontal major axis; foci (±4,0); e=4/5.｜水平長軸；焦點(±4,0)；e=4/5。','The denominator is a squared semiaxis, not a full axis length.｜分母是半軸平方，不是全軸長。'),
 E('standard','definition-to-equation','An ellipse has foci (±3,0) and distance sum 10. Derive its equation.｜橢圓焦點為(±3,0)，到兩焦點的距離和為10。求方程。','',null,['The distance sum equals 2a.｜距離和等於2a。','Use b²=a²−c².｜用b²=a²−c²。'],[['Read a=5 and c=3.｜讀出a=5、c=3。','b^2=25-9=16'],['Use the horizontal-major-axis form.｜使用水平長軸形式。','x^2/25+y^2/16=1']],'x²/25+y²/16=1.｜x²/25+y²/16=1。','Using a=10 would double the intended distance sum.｜取a=10會令距離和加倍。'),
 E('transfer','focal-extremum','Find the greatest possible distance from a point on this ellipse to its right focus.｜求橢圓上一點到右焦點的最大距離。','x^2/25+y^2/9=1',9,['The farthest vertex is on the opposite end of the major axis.｜最遠頂點在長軸另一端。','Use the focal-distance relation r=a−ex.｜使用焦距關係r=a−ex。'],[['Here a=5,c=4 and −5≤x≤5.｜此處a=5、c=4，且−5≤x≤5。','r=5-4x/5'],['The minimum x gives the maximum r.｜最小x給最大r。','r_{§max}=5+4=9']],'Maximum 9 at (−5,0).｜最大9，在(−5,0)取得。','The focal sum 10 is not either individual focal distance.｜焦距和10不等於任一單獨焦距。'),
 N('foundation','focal-parameter','Find c, the centre-to-focus distance.｜求中心至焦點距離c。','x^2/16+y^2/7=1',3,['Subtract the squared semiaxes.｜把半軸平方相減。','c is positive.｜c為正。'],[['Use the ellipse relation.｜用橢圓關係。','c^2=16-7=9'],['Take the positive root.｜取正平方根。','c=3']],'c=3.｜c=3。','The plus relation belongs to a hyperbola.｜相加關係屬雙曲線。'),
 W('foundation','vertical-orientation','Find the foci of the vertical ellipse.｜求垂直橢圓的焦點。','x^2/9+y^2/25=1',null,['The larger denominator is under y².｜較大分母在y²下。','Place c on the vertical axis.｜把c放在垂直軸。'],[['Calculate c².｜求c²。','c^2=25-9=16'],['Place the foci about the origin.｜把焦點置於原點兩側。','F_1=(0,-4),§ F_2=(0,4)']],'(0,±4).｜(0,±4)。','The letter x does not automatically indicate the major axis.｜x不會自動代表長軸方向。'),
 N('foundation','focal-sum','Find the constant sum of focal distances.｜求到兩焦點距離之和的常數。','x^2/36+y^2/20=1',12,['Read the major semiaxis.｜讀出長半軸。','The defining sum is twice it.｜定義距離和為其兩倍。'],[['The major semiaxis is √36.｜長半軸為√36。','a=6'],['Use the focal definition.｜用焦點定義。','r_1+r_2=2a=12']],'12.｜12。','The sum is independent of the point on the ellipse.｜距離和不隨橢圓上的點而變。'),
 N('foundation','point-substitution','The point (3,y) lies on the ellipse. Find y².｜點(3,y)在橢圓上，求y²。','x^2/25+y^2/16=1',10.24,['Substitute x=3.｜代入x=3。','Solve for y² before choosing a sign.｜選符號前先求y²。'],[['Rearrange the residual fraction.｜整理剩下的分數。','y^2/16=1-9/25=16/25'],['Multiply by the denominator.｜乘以分母。','y^2=256/25']],'y²=256/25.｜y²=256/25。','Both signs of y are possible; its square is unique.｜y可有兩個符號，但平方唯一。'),
 W('standard','parameter-feasibility','For which k is the locus a noncircular, nondegenerate ellipse?｜哪些k使軌跡為非圓且非退化的橢圓？','x^2/9+y^2/k=1',null,['Both denominators must be positive.｜兩分母須為正。','Equal denominators give a circle.｜分母相等得到圓。'],[['Exclude zero and negative k.｜排除零及負k。','k>0'],['Exclude the circle while permitting either major-axis direction.｜排除圓，但容許兩種長軸方向。','k§ne9']],'k>0 and k≠9.｜k>0且k≠9。','k>9 is also an ellipse; it simply has a vertical major axis.｜k>9亦為橢圓，只是長軸垂直。'),
 N('standard','eccentricity','Find the eccentricity.｜求離心率。','x^2/100+y^2/36=1',0.8,['Find c before dividing.｜先求c，再相除。','Use c/a, not b/a.｜用c/a，不是b/a。'],[['Find the focal distance.｜求焦距。','c=§sqrt{100-36}=8'],['Divide by the major semiaxis.｜除以長半軸。','e=8/10=4/5']],'e=4/5.｜e=4/5。','For a noncircular ellipse, 0<e<1.｜非圓橢圓滿足0<e<1。'),
 W('standard','translation','Find the centre, major-axis vertices and foci.｜求中心、長軸頂點及焦點。','(x-2)^2/16+(y+1)^2/7=1',null,['Subtract the centre shift before reading parameters.｜先辨認平移中心，再讀參數。','The focal distance is 3.｜焦距為3。'],[['The centre is (2,−1), with a=4.｜中心(2,−1)，a=4。','V=(2§pm4,-1)'],['Translate both foci consistently.｜一致平移兩焦點。','F=(2§pm3,-1)']],'Centre (2,−1); major-axis vertices (−2,−1),(6,−1); foci (−1,−1),(5,−1).｜中心(2,−1)；長軸頂點(−2,−1)、(6,−1)；焦點(−1,−1)、(5,−1)。','The sign in y+1 places the centre at y=−1.｜y+1表示中心的y=−1。'),
 W('standard','degenerate-definition','The foci are (−3,0),(3,0), and the focal-distance sum is 6. Is the locus a nondegenerate ellipse? Describe it.｜焦點為(−3,0)、(3,0)，焦距和為6。軌跡是非退化橢圓嗎？描述它。','',null,['The sum equals the distance between foci.｜距離和等於兩焦點間距。','Use the equality case of the triangle inequality.｜使用三角不等式的等號情況。'],[['Equality forces the point onto the segment joining the foci.｜等號迫使點位於連焦點線段上。','r_1+r_2=|F_1F_2|'],['Every point of that closed segment has the required sum.｜該閉線段上每點均有指定距離和。']],'The closed segment −3≤x≤3,y=0, not a nondegenerate ellipse.｜閉線段−3≤x≤3、y=0，不是非退化橢圓。','A genuine ellipse needs the distance sum strictly larger than the focal separation.｜真正橢圓要求距離和嚴格大於焦點間距。'),
 W('transfer','ellipse-linear-optimization','Find the maximum of 3x+4y on the ellipse, and give an attaining point.｜求橢圓上3x+4y的最大值，並給出取等點。','x^2/4+y^2/9=1',null,['Set x=2u,y=3v with u²+v²=1.｜令x=2u、y=3v，則u²+v²=1。','Apply the dot-product bound in scaled coordinates.｜在伸縮坐標中使用數量積上界。'],[['Set u=x/2 and v=y/3, so u²+v²=1; the objective becomes a dot product with (6,12).｜設u＝x/2、v＝y/3，則u²＋v²＝1；目標變成與(6,12)的數量積。','3x+4y=6u+12v§le§sqrt{180}=6§sqrt5'],['Equality requires parallel unit directions.｜等號要求單位方向相同。','(u,v)=(1/§sqrt5,2/§sqrt5)']],'Maximum 6√5 at (2/√5,6/√5).｜最大6√5，在(2/√5,6/√5)取得。','Bounding 3x and 4y separately gives an unattainable corner.｜分別取3x及4y最大值，會得到不可達到的角點。'),
 W('transfer','locus-recovery','P has distance sum 10 to (±3,0) and lies above the x-axis at x=0. Find P, then explain why replacing sum 10 by 5 makes the locus empty.｜P到(±3,0)的距離和為10，且在x=0的上半平面。求P，再解釋把距離和改為5為何軌跡為空。','',null,['At x=0 both distances are equal.｜x=0時兩距離相等。','Compare the proposed sum 5 with focal separation 6.｜比較距離和5與焦點間距6。'],[['Each distance is 5, so y²+9=25.｜每距離為5，因此y²+9=25。','P=(0,4)'],['Any two focal distances sum to at least the focal separation.｜兩焦距和至少等於焦點間距。','r_1+r_2§ge6>5']],'P=(0,4); the sum-5 locus is empty.｜P=(0,4)；距離和5的軌跡為空。','Writing a standard-looking equation does not guarantee a geometrically possible locus.｜寫出貌似標準方程，不保證幾何軌跡可行。'),
];
