const hyperbola=[
 E('foundation','hyperbola-parameters','Find the vertices, foci and asymptotes.｜求頂點、焦點及漸近線。','x^2/9-y^2/16=1',null,['The positive term sets the transverse axis.｜正項決定實軸方向。','For a hyperbola, c² is a sum.｜雙曲線的c²為平方和。'],[['Read a=3,b=4,c=5.｜讀出a=3、b=4、c=5。','c^2=9+16=25'],['Place the vertices/foci on x and set the homogeneous quadratic to zero.｜把頂點、焦點置於x軸，再令齊次二次式為零。','V=(§pm3,0),§ F=(§pm5,0),§ y=§pm4x/3']],'Vertices (±3,0), foci (±5,0), asymptotes y=±4x/3.｜頂點(±3,0)、焦點(±5,0)、漸近線y=±4x/3。','The asymptotes pass through the centre, not a focus.｜漸近線經中心，不是焦點。'),
 E('standard','hyperbola-definition','The foci are (±5,0), and the absolute focal-distance difference is 6. Find the equation.｜焦點為(±5,0)，焦距差的絕對值為6，求方程。','',null,['The constant is 2a.｜常數為2a。','Recover b²=c²−a².｜還原b²=c²−a²。'],[['Use a=3,c=5.｜用a=3、c=5。','b^2=25-9=16'],['Keep both branches because the difference is absolute.｜距離差取絕對值，故保留兩支。','x^2/9-y^2/16=1']],'x²/9−y²/16=1.｜x²/9−y²/16=1。','A signed distance difference would select one branch.｜有符號距離差會只選一支。'),
 E('transfer','one-intersection-warning','The line y=x+1 meets x²−y²=1 once. Is it tangent? Justify.｜直線y=x+1與x²−y²=1只有一個交點。它是切線嗎？證明。','',null,['Substitution may reduce the degree.｜代入後可能降次。','Compare the actual tangent slope at the intersection.｜比較交點的真正切線斜率。'],[['The quadratic terms cancel, leaving one root.｜二次項抵消，只剩一根。','x^2-(x+1)^2=1§Rightarrow x=-1,§quad y=0'],['The tangent at (−1,0) is vertical, whereas y=x+1 is not.｜(−1,0)的切線垂直，而y=x+1並非垂直線。','x=-1']],'Not tangent; it is parallel to an asymptote.｜不是切線；它平行於一條漸近線。','One intersection does not imply tangency when the substituted equation becomes linear.｜消元方程降為一次時，一個交點不代表相切。'),
 N('foundation','hyperbola-focus','Find the centre-to-focus distance c.｜求中心至焦點距離c。','x^2/16-y^2/9=1',5,['Add the squared parameters.｜相加平方參數。','Take the positive square root.｜取正平方根。'],[['Use c²=a²+b².｜用c²=a²+b²。','c^2=16+9=25'],['Convert to distance.｜轉成距離。','c=5']],'c=5.｜c=5。','Subtracting would use the ellipse relation.｜相減會誤用橢圓關係。'),
 N('foundation','hyperbola-eccentricity','Find the eccentricity.｜求離心率。','x^2/9-y^2/16=1',5/3,['The focus distance is 5.｜焦距為5。','Divide by the transverse semiaxis 3.｜除以實半軸3。'],[['Find c/a.｜求c/a。','e=§sqrt{9+16}/3'],['Simplify.｜化簡。','e=5/3']],'e=5/3.｜e=5/3。','A hyperbola has e>1, so 3/5 cannot be correct.｜雙曲線e>1，因此3/5不正確。'),
 W('foundation','hyperbola-vertical','Find the vertices and asymptotes.｜求頂點及漸近線。','y^2/4-x^2/9=1',null,['The positive term is vertical.｜正項在垂直方向。','Set the quadratic difference to zero for asymptotes.｜求漸近線時令二次差為零。'],[['The vertices have x=0.｜頂點的x=0。','V=(0,§pm2)'],['Solve the homogeneous equation.｜解齊次方程。','y^2/4=x^2/9§Rightarrow y=§pm2x/3']],'Vertices (0,±2); asymptotes y=±2x/3.｜頂點(0,±2)；漸近線y=±2x/3。','Do not interchange the slope ratio merely because the major letter changes.｜不可只因字母改變便任意倒轉斜率比。'),
 N('foundation','hyperbola-point','A point (5,y) lies on x²/9−y²/16=1. Find y².｜點(5,y)在x²/9−y²/16=1上，求y²。','',256/9,['Move the negative term to the other side.｜把負項移到另一邊。','Keep exact fractions.｜保留精確分數。'],[['Substitute x=5.｜代入x=5。','y^2/16=25/9-1=16/9'],['Multiply by 16.｜乘16。','y^2=256/9']],'y²=256/9.｜y²=256/9。','There are two y values; neither changes the branch x>0.｜有兩個y值；兩者均仍在x>0分支。'),
 W('standard','hyperbola-domain','Describe the possible x-coordinates on the hyperbola.｜描述雙曲線上可取的x坐標。','x^2/9-y^2/16=1',null,['The y² term is nonnegative.｜y²項非負。','Solve the resulting square inequality as a union.｜平方不等式的解須寫成聯集。'],[['Rearrange to bound x².｜整理並限制x²。','x^2/9=1+y^2/16§ge1'],['Every x in the resulting rays gives real y.｜所得兩射線中的每個x均給實數y。','x§le-3§text{ or }x§ge3']],'(−∞,−3]∪[3,∞).｜(−∞,−3]∪[3,∞)。','Using −3≤x≤3 would describe the excluded central strip.｜−3≤x≤3描述的是被排除的中央區域。'),
 W('standard','asymptote-nonmembership','Prove that no finite point of y=4x/3 lies on this hyperbola.｜證明y=4x/3上沒有任何有限點位於此雙曲線。','x^2/9-y^2/16=1',null,['Substitute the line exactly.｜精確代入直線。','The left side becomes a constant.｜左邊變為常數。'],[['Both squared terms become equal.｜兩平方項相等。','x^2/9-(4x/3)^2/16=0'],['The equation would require 0=1.｜方程將要求0=1。']],'There is no finite intersection.｜沒有有限交點。','An asymptote is approached at infinity; it is not part of the curve.｜漸近線在無窮遠被趨近，不屬曲線本身。'),
 N('standard','rectangular-hyperbola','A horizontal hyperbola has a=3 and perpendicular asymptotes. Find b.｜水平雙曲線a=3，兩漸近線垂直，求b。','a>0,§ b>0',3,['The slopes are b/a and −b/a.｜斜率為b/a及−b/a。','Their product is −1.｜斜率乘積為−1。'],[['Use perpendicular slopes.｜使用垂直斜率條件。','-b^2/9=-1'],['Choose the positive parameter.｜取正參數。','b=3']],'b=3.｜b=3。','The negative root does not represent a positive semiaxis parameter.｜負根不能代表正半軸參數。'),
 W('standard','signed-branch','Which branch satisfies PF₁−PF₂=6?｜哪一支滿足PF₁−PF₂=6？','F_1=(-5,0),F_2=(5,0),§ x^2/9-y^2/16=1',null,['Test the right vertex.｜檢查右頂點。','The signed difference is constant on each branch.｜有符號差在每一支為常數。'],[['At (3,0), the distances are 8 and 2.｜(3,0)到兩焦點距離為8及2。','PF_1-PF_2=6'],['The right branch is farther from the left focus.｜右支到左焦點較遠。','x§ge3']],'The right branch, x≥3.｜右支，x≥3。','The absolute-value equation alone includes both branches.｜只有絕對值方程會包含兩支。'),
 W('transfer','recover-from-asymptotes','A centred horizontal hyperbola has asymptotes y=±2x and passes through (√2,2). Find its equation.｜以原點為中心的水平雙曲線，漸近線y=±2x，且過(√2,2)，求方程。','',null,['The slopes give b=2a.｜斜率給b=2a。','The point fixes the remaining scale.｜已知點決定剩下的大小。'],[['Insert b²=4a² into the point equation.｜把b²=4a²代入點的方程。','2/a^2-4/(4a^2)=1'],['Recover both parameters.｜還原兩參數。','a^2=1,§ b^2=4']],'x²−y²/4=1.｜x²−y²/4=1。','Asymptotes determine shape but not scale; a point is also needed.｜漸近線決定形狀，但不決定大小；還需要一點。'),
 W('transfer','hyperbola-feasibility','Two foci are 10 units apart. Classify loci with absolute distance difference d for d=0,6,10,12.｜兩焦點相距10。當距離差絕對值d分別為0、6、10、12時，分類軌跡。','F_1=(-5,0),§ F_2=(5,0)',null,['The reverse triangle inequality bounds d by 10.｜反三角不等式給d≤10。','Analyze both equality boundaries geometrically.｜幾何分析兩個邊界。'],[['Zero difference gives the perpendicular bisector; an interior positive difference gives a hyperbola.｜零差給垂直平分線；中間正差給雙曲線。','d=0:x=0;§ d=6:x^2/9-y^2/16=1'],['Maximum difference occurs on the exterior focal rays; larger differences are impossible.｜最大差出現在焦點外側射線；更大的差不可能。','d=10:y=0,|x|§ge5;§ d=12:§varnothing']],'Line; nondegenerate hyperbola; two exterior rays; empty set, respectively.｜依次為直線、非退化雙曲線、兩外側射線、空集。','The defining constant must satisfy 0<d<10 for a nondegenerate hyperbola.｜非退化雙曲線的定義常數須滿足0<d<10。'),
];
const hyperbolaD=[
 D('diagnostic-hyperbola-relation','Choose c² for x²/9−y²/16=1.｜對x²/9−y²/16=1，選出c²。','',['7','25','5','-7'],'B',[['A','Subtracted the smaller square.｜把平方相減。'],['C','Returned c instead of c².｜返回c而非c²。'],['D','Used the signed denominator difference.｜用了有符號分母差。']],['A focus lies beyond a vertex.｜焦點在頂點外側。','Use a²+b².｜用a²+b²。'],[['Apply the hyperbola relation.｜用雙曲線關係。','c^2=9+16'],['Add the parameters.｜把參數相加。','c^2=25']],'B: 25.｜B：25。','The ellipse subtraction formula does not apply.｜橢圓的相減公式不適用。'),
 D('diagnostic-asymptote','Choose the positive-slope asymptote of x²/9−y²/16=1.｜選出x²/9−y²/16=1的正斜率漸近線。','',['y=3x/4','y=4x/3','y=16x/9','y=4x/3+5'],'B',[['A','Inverted the semiaxis ratio.｜倒轉半軸比。'],['C','Used squared parameters as lengths.｜把平方參數當長度。'],['D','Shifted to a focus rather than the centre.｜平移到焦點而非中心。']],['Remove the constant term.｜去掉常數項。','Take the positive square-root branch.｜取正平方根分支。'],[['Set the homogeneous quadratic to zero.｜令齊次二次式為零。','y^2/16=x^2/9'],['Use the required positive slope.｜取指定正斜率。','y=4x/3']],'B.｜B。','The asymptote slopes depend on semiaxes, not their squares.｜漸近線斜率取決於半軸，不是其平方。'),
];
const parabola=[
 E('foundation','focus-directrix','Find the vertex, focus and directrix.｜求頂點、焦點及準線。','y^2=12x',null,['Compare with y²=4ax.｜與y²=4ax比較。','The focus and directrix are equally far from the vertex.｜焦點及準線與頂點等距。'],[['Read 4a=12.｜讀出4a=12。','a=3'],['Place the focus on the opening axis.｜把焦點置於開口軸上。','V=(0,0),§ F=(3,0),§ d:x=-3']],'Vertex (0,0), focus (3,0), directrix x=−3.｜頂點(0,0)、焦點(3,0)、準線x=−3。','The coefficient 12 is four times the focal distance.｜係數12是焦距的四倍。'),
 E('standard','locus-derivation','Derive the locus equidistant from focus (2,0) and directrix x=−2.｜推導到焦點(2,0)與準線x=−2等距的軌跡。','',null,['Distance to the line is |x+2|.｜到直線距離為|x+2|。','Both distances are nonnegative before squaring.｜平方前兩距離均非負。'],[['Equate squared distances.｜令距離平方相等。','(x-2)^2+y^2=(x+2)^2'],['Cancel matching terms and check x≥0 follows.｜約去相同項，並檢查x≥0由方程推出。','y^2=8x']],'y²=8x.｜y²=8x。','Using signed x+2 without explaining nonnegativity can hide an invalid distance interpretation.｜不解釋非負性便使用有符號x+2，可能隱藏無效距離解釋。'),
 E('transfer','nearest-focus','Find the point on y²=8x closest to the focus and its distance.｜求y²=8x上最接近焦點的點及距離。','',2,['Focal distance equals distance to the directrix.｜焦距等於到準線距離。','The curve forces x≥0.｜曲線要求x≥0。'],[['The focus is (2,0) and the directrix x=−2.｜焦點(2,0)、準線x=−2。','PF=x+2'],['Minimize x on the parabola.｜把拋物線上的x最小化。','x=0,§quad y=0,§ PF=2']],'Distance 2 at the vertex (0,0).｜頂點(0,0)處距離為2。','The focus is not on the parabola.｜焦點不在拋物線上。'),
 N('foundation','focal-coefficient','Find the focus y-coordinate.｜求焦點的y坐標。','x^2=20y',5,['The axis is vertical.｜對稱軸垂直。','Read 4a=20.｜讀出4a=20。'],[['Convert the coefficient to focal distance.｜把係數轉成焦距。','a=20/4=5'],['The focus lies in the opening direction.｜焦點位於開口方向。','F=(0,5)']],'Focus y-coordinate 5.｜焦點y坐標5。','Interchanging x and y also interchanges the focus coordinate.｜交換x、y亦須交換焦點坐標。'),
 W('foundation','negative-opening','Find the focus and directrix.｜求焦點及準線。','y^2=-8x',null,['The parameter a is negative.｜參數a為負。','Keep its sign when locating the focus.｜定位焦點時保留符號。'],[['Read a=−2.｜讀出a=−2。','4a=-8'],['The parabola opens left.｜拋物線向左開口。','F=(-2,0),§ d:x=2']],'Focus (−2,0), directrix x=2.｜焦點(−2,0)、準線x=2。','A negative opening coefficient is valid, not an empty locus.｜開口係數為負仍有效，並非空軌跡。'),
 N('foundation','parabola-point','For a point (x,4) on y²=8x, find x.｜點(x,4)在y²=8x上，求x。','',2,['Substitute the y-coordinate.｜代入y坐標。','Divide its square by 8.｜把其平方除以8。'],[['Square y=4.｜把y=4平方。','16=8x'],['Solve the linear equation.｜解一次方程。','x=2']],'x=2.｜x=2。','Using y=4 directly instead of y² gives the wrong result.｜直接用y=4而非y²會得錯誤結果。'),
 N('foundation','latus-rectum','Find the length of the chord through the focus perpendicular to the axis.｜求過焦點且垂直對稱軸的弦長。','y^2=8x',8,['The focus is at x=2.｜焦點的x=2。','Find both y-coordinates.｜求兩個y坐標。'],[['Substitute x=2.｜代入x=2。','y^2=16§Rightarrow y=§pm4'],['Subtract the endpoint coordinates.｜把端點坐標相減。','L=4-(-4)=8']],'Chord length 8.｜弦長8。','A single ordinate 4 is half the chord.｜單一縱坐標4只是弦的一半。'),
 W('standard','parabola-translation','Find the vertex, focus, directrix and opening direction.｜求頂點、焦點、準線及開口方向。','(y-1)^2=8(x+2)',null,['Use shifted coordinates X=x+2,Y=y−1.｜用平移坐標X=x+2、Y=y−1。','Translate focus and directrix back together.｜同時把焦點及準線平移回去。'],[['In shifted coordinates a=2.｜平移坐標中a=2。','V=(-2,1),§ F=V+(2,0)=(0,1)'],['The directrix is two units left of the vertex.｜準線在頂點左方兩單位。','d:x=-4']],'Vertex (−2,1), focus (0,1), directrix x=−4; opens right.｜頂點(−2,1)、焦點(0,1)、準線x=−4；向右開口。','The focus is not obtained by shifting only the x-coordinate of the equation coefficient.｜不能只把方程係數的x坐標平移便求焦點。'),
 W('standard','vertex-not-centre','Explain why the vertex of y²=8x is not a centre of symmetry.｜解釋y²=8x的頂點為何不是對稱中心。','P=(2,4)',null,['Rotate the displayed point by 180° about the origin.｜把所示點繞原點旋轉180°。','Test the image in the equation.｜把像點代入方程。'],[['The image is (−2,−4).｜像點為(−2,−4)。','(-4)^2=16§ne8(-2)'],['A centre would preserve every point under that rotation.｜對稱中心須令每點旋轉後仍在曲線上。']],'The origin is a vertex, not a symmetry centre.｜原點是頂點，不是對稱中心。','Reflection across the x-axis is a different symmetry from a half-turn.｜關於x軸反射，與半周旋轉是不同對稱。'),
 N('standard','focal-distance','A point on y²=8x has x=6. Find its distance to the focus.｜y²=8x上一點的x=6，求它到焦點的距離。','',8,['Use the focus-directrix definition.｜使用焦點準線定義。','The directrix is x=−2.｜準線為x=−2。'],[['Compute the horizontal distance to the directrix.｜計算到準線的水平距離。','PF=|6-(-2)|'],['The two choices of y share this distance.｜兩個y值共用此距離。','PF=8']],'Distance 8.｜距離8。','There is no need to select a sign of y.｜不必選擇y的符號。'),
 W('standard','degenerate-parabola','Classify the equation y²=4ax when a=0 and explain the failed focal interpretation.｜a=0時，分類y²=4ax並解釋焦點準線解釋的問題。','',null,['Set the parameter to zero explicitly.｜明確代入參數零。','The focus would lie on the directrix.｜焦點會落在準線上。'],[['The equation becomes a repeated line.｜方程成為重直線。','y^2=0§Rightarrow y=0'],['A nondegenerate parabola requires its focus to lie off the directrix; at a=0 the focus lies on it.｜非退化拋物線要求焦點不在準線上；a＝0時焦點卻在準線上。']],'The x-axis as a degenerate conic; not a nondegenerate parabola.｜退化圓錐曲線x軸；不是非退化拋物線。','A zero coefficient must be treated before dividing by a.｜除以a前，須先處理係數零。'),
 W('transfer','reverse-focus-directrix','A parabola has focus (1,3) and directrix y=−1. Derive its equation and vertex.｜拋物線焦點(1,3)、準線y=−1，推導其方程及頂點。','',null,['The axis is perpendicular to the directrix through the focus.｜對稱軸過焦點並垂直準線。','The vertex bisects the perpendicular focus-directrix gap.｜頂點平分焦點至準線的垂直距離。'],[['The vertex is (1,1), with a=2 upward.｜頂點(1,1)，a=2且向上。','(x-1)^2=8(y-1)'],['Verify directly by squared distances.｜用距離平方直接核對。','(x-1)^2+(y-3)^2=(y+1)^2']],'Vertex (1,1); (x−1)²=8(y−1).｜頂點(1,1)；(x−1)²=8(y−1)。','The focus-to-directrix gap is 2a, not a.｜焦點至準線的間距是2a，不是a。'),
 W('transfer','distance-minimization','P lies on y²=8x. Minimize PF+PQ, where F=(2,0) and Q=(8,0). State all equality conditions.｜P在y²=8x上，F=(2,0)、Q=(8,0)。求PF+PQ最小值，列出全部取等條件。','',null,['Replace PF by x+2.｜把PF換成x+2。','Use PQ≥|x−8|, but check equality on the curve.｜用PQ≥|x−8|，再檢查曲線上的等號。'],[['For x≥0, x+2+|x−8|≥10.｜x≥0時，x+2+|x−8|≥10。','PF+PQ§ge x+2+|x-8|§ge10'],['Equality in the distance bound requires y=0; the parabola then forces x=0.｜距離下界取等須y=0；拋物線再要求x=0。','P=(0,0),§ PF+PQ=2+8=10']],'Minimum 10, attained only at the vertex.｜最小10，只在頂點取得。','The scalar bound is flat for 0≤x≤8, but not every such x is an equality point on the curve.｜標量下界在0≤x≤8恆定，但曲線上並非每個此類x都取等。'),
];
const parabolaD=[
 D('diagnostic-four-factor','Choose the focus of y²=8x.｜選出y²=8x的焦點。','',['(8,0)','(4,0)','(2,0)','(0,2)'],'C',[['A','Used the whole coefficient.｜用了整個係數。'],['B','Confused the 2p and 4a conventions.｜混淆2p與4a記號。'],['D','Interchanged the opening axis.｜交換開口軸。']],['Compare with y²=4ax.｜與y²=4ax比較。','The axis is horizontal.｜軸為水平。'],[['Read a=8/4.｜讀出a=8/4。','a=2'],['Put a on the x-axis.｜把a放在x軸。','F=(2,0)']],'C.｜C。','State which standard-form convention is being used.｜須說明使用哪種標準形式約定。'),
 D('diagnostic-translated-vertex','Choose the vertex of (y−2)²=4(x+3).｜選出(y−2)²=4(x+3)的頂點。','',['(3,2)','(-3,2)','(-2,3)','(-3,-2)'],'B',[['A','Ignored the sign of the horizontal shift.｜忽略水平平移符號。'],['C','Interchanged coordinates.｜交换坐標。'],['D','Reversed the vertical shift.｜倒轉垂直平移。']],['Set both shifted coordinates to zero.｜令兩個平移坐標為零。','Solve x+3=0 and y−2=0.｜解x+3=0及y−2=0。'],[['The square is zero at y=2.｜y=2時平方為零。','y=2'],['The right side is zero at x=−3.｜x=−3時右邊為零。','x=-3']],'B: (−3,2).｜B：(−3,2)。','A vertex is not generally the focus.｜頂點通常不是焦點。'),
];
const intersections=[
 E('foundation','line-substitution','Find both intersections of the ellipse and the line.｜求橢圓與直線的兩個交點。','x^2/9+y^2/4=1,§ y=1',null,['Substitute the fixed y-coordinate.｜代入固定y坐標。','Recover both square-root signs.｜保留平方根兩個符號。'],[['The remaining quadratic is in x only.｜餘下二次式只含x。','x^2/9=3/4'],['Pair each x with the original y.｜把每個x配上原y。','(x,y)=(§pm3§sqrt3/2,1)']],'(±3√3/2,1).｜(±3√3/2,1)。','An x-root alone is not a complete intersection point.｜只有x根，不是完整交點。'),
 E('standard','parabola-secant','Find the intersections, retaining the vertex.｜求交點，並保留頂點。','y^2=4x,§ y=x',null,['Substitute y=x.｜代入y=x。','Factor without dividing by x.｜因式分解，不要除以x。'],[['The equation includes a zero root.｜方程包含零根。','x^2-4x=x(x-4)=0'],['Return each root to y=x.｜把每根代回y=x。','(x,y)=(0,0),(4,4)']],'(0,0) and (4,4).｜(0,0)及(4,4)。','Dividing by x would lose the vertex.｜除以x會漏掉頂點。'),
 E('transfer','degree-loss-classification','Classify intersections with y=x+k for all real k. Explain why counting one point is insufficient for tangency.｜對全部實數k，分類與y=x+k的交點，解釋一個交點為何不足以判斷相切。','x^2-y^2=1',null,['Keep the leading coefficient after substitution.｜代入後須檢查首項係數。','Separate k=0 before dividing.｜相除前分開k=0。'],[['The quadratic cancels.｜二次項抵消。','-2kx-k^2=1'],['Zero k is inconsistent; nonzero k gives one finite point.｜k零時矛盾；非零時有一個有限交點。','x=-(1+k^2)/(2k),§ y=(k^2-1)/(2k)'],['Slope one cannot be a tangent direction because that would require x=y on this curve.｜斜率一不可能是切線方向，否則要求曲線上x=y。']],'No intersection for k=0; one nontangent intersection for k≠0.｜k=0時無交點；k≠0時有一個非相切交點。','A discriminant test presupposes an actual quadratic.｜判別式檢驗先假設方程確實為二次。'),
 N('foundation','horizontal-chord','Find the chord length cut by y=0.｜求y=0截出的弦長。','x^2/9+y^2/4=1',6,['The endpoints are on the major axis.｜端點位於長軸。','Subtract their coordinates.｜把其坐標相減。'],[['Set y=0 to obtain x=±3.｜令y=0，得x=±3。','x^2=9'],['Measure between both vertices.｜量度兩頂點之間。','L=3-(-3)=6']],'Length 6.｜長度6。','One semiaxis is only half this chord.｜一條半軸只是這條弦的一半。'),
 N('foundation','intersection-count','How many real intersections are there?｜有多少個實交點？','x^2/9+y^2/4=1,§ y=3',0,['The y-term already exceeds one.｜y项已大於一。','A real square cannot be negative.｜實數平方不能為負。'],[['Substitute y=3.｜代入y=3。','x^2/9=1-9/4=-5/4'],['No real x satisfies it.｜沒有實數x滿足。']],'Zero intersections.｜零個交點。','Do not take a real square root of a negative number.｜不可把負數開成實數平方根。'),
 W('foundation','repeated-root','Show that y=x+1 is tangent to y²=4x and find the contact point.｜證明y=x+1與y²=4x相切，並求切點。','',null,['Substitute and collect a genuine quadratic.｜代入並整理成真正二次方程。','A repeated root identifies the contact point here.｜此處重根辨認切點。'],[['The substituted equation is a perfect square.｜消元式為完全平方。','(x+1)^2=4x§Rightarrow(x-1)^2=0'],['Back-substitute and check the slope.｜代回並檢查斜率。','(x,y)=(1,2),§ 2y y§prime=4§Rightarrow y§prime=1']],'Tangent at (1,2).｜在(1,2)相切。','One must check that the quadratic leading coefficient is nonzero.｜須檢查二次首項係數非零。'),
 W('foundation','central-chord','Explain why the midpoint of any chord through the centre of an ellipse is the centre.｜解釋為何通過橢圓中心的任何弦，其中點都是中心。','x^2/9+y^2/4=1',null,['The equation is unchanged under (x,y)→(−x,−y).｜方程在(x,y)→(−x,−y)下不變。','A line through the origin also retains that symmetry.｜過原點直線亦保留此對稱。'],[['The two endpoints occur as opposite pairs.｜兩端點形成相反點對。','B=-A'],['Their average is the centre.｜平均即中心。','(A+B)/2=(0,0)']],'The midpoint is (0,0).｜中點為(0,0)。','This argument requires a central chord, not an arbitrary chord.｜此推理要求弦經中心，不適用任意弦。'),
 N('standard','tangent-parameter','For tangency with y=x+b, find b².｜y=x+b與橢圓相切時，求b²。','x^2/9+y^2/4=1',13,['Substitute and keep the parameter b.｜代入並保留參數b。','Set the quadratic discriminant to zero.｜令二次判別式為零。'],[['Clear denominators.｜去分母。','13x^2+18bx+9b^2-36=0'],['Solve the zero-discriminant equation.｜解判別式為零的方程。','§Delta=144(13-b^2)=0']],'b²=13, giving b=±√13.｜b²=13，故b=±√13。','Two parallel tangents exist, one on each side.｜有兩條平行切線，分處兩側。'),
 W('standard','vieta-midpoint','Find the midpoint of the chord without solving both endpoints.｜不逐一解兩端點，求弦中點。','x^2/9+y^2/4=1,§ y=x+1',null,['Use the sum of quadratic roots.｜使用二次根之和。','The line relates the average y to average x.｜直線把平均y與平均x連結。'],[['Substitution gives root sum −18/13.｜代入後得根和−18/13。','13x^2+18x-27=0'],['Halve the sum and use y=x+1.｜把根和減半，再用y=x+1。','M=(-9/13,4/13)']],'M=(−9/13,4/13).｜M=(−9/13,4/13)。','The midpoint is generally inside the ellipse, not on it.｜弦中點通常在橢圓內，不在其上。'),
 W('standard','vertical-tangent','Find the tangent at the right vertex and explain why y=mx+b cannot describe it.｜求右頂點切線，並解釋y=mx+b為何不能表示它。','x^2/9+y^2/4=1',null,['The right vertex is (3,0).｜右頂點為(3,0)。','A tangent there is perpendicular to the horizontal radius.｜該處切線垂直水平半徑。'],[['The tangent equation fixes x.｜切線方程固定x。','x=3'],['Its slope is undefined, so no finite m works.｜其斜率未定義，沒有有限m適用。']],'x=3.｜x=3。','Slope-form parameterizations omit vertical lines.｜斜率式參數表示會漏掉垂直線。'),
 N('standard','chord-square','Find the squared length of the chord cut by y=1.｜求y=1所截弦長的平方。','x^2/9+y^2/4=1',27,['The endpoints have opposite x-coordinates.｜端點有相反x坐標。','The horizontal difference is twice either positive root.｜水平差為正根兩倍。'],[['Find the squared x-coordinate.｜求x坐標平方。','x^2=27/4'],['Square the full chord length.｜把整條弦長平方。','L^2=4x^2=27']],'L²=27.｜L²=27。','Doubling a length quadruples its square.｜長度加倍，平方變四倍。'),
 W('transfer','midpoint-locus','All lines through P=(0,1) cut the ellipse in a chord. Find the locus of its midpoint M=(h,k), including the vertical line case.｜所有過P=(0,1)的直線與橢圓形成弦。求其中點M=(h,k)的軌跡，須包括垂直線。','x^2/9+y^2/4=1',null,['For y=mx+1 use Vieta to obtain h,k.｜對y=mx+1用韋達求h、k。','Eliminate m, then restore any missing vertical case.｜消去m，再補回遺漏的垂直情況。'],[['The substituted quadratic gives the midpoint parametrization.｜消元二次式給出中點參數。','h=-9m/(4+9m^2),§ k=4/(4+9m^2)'],['Eliminate m and complete a square.｜消去m並配方。','h^2/9+k(k-1)/4=0'],['Finite m gives k>0; the vertical chord adds (0,0). All other locus points recover m=−4h/(9k).｜有限m給k>0；垂直弦補入(0,0)。其餘軌跡點可還原m=−4h/(9k)。','h^2/(9/16)+(k-1/2)^2/(1/4)=1']],'The complete ellipse h²/(9/16)+(k−1/2)²/(1/4)=1.｜完整橢圓h²/(9/16)+(k−1/2)²/(1/4)=1。','Elimination alone can hide a missing point caused by slope form.｜只作消元，會掩蓋斜率形式漏掉的點。'),
 W('transfer','inverse-chord','A chord of y²=4x has midpoint (2,1). Recover the chord line and both endpoints.｜y²=4x的一條弦，中點為(2,1)。還原弦所在直線及兩端點。','',null,['Let the endpoint ordinates be y₁,y₂.｜設端點縱坐標為y₁、y₂。','Use their sum and the midpoint x-coordinate to obtain their product.｜用縱坐標和及中點x坐標求乘積。'],[['Midpoint conditions give sum 2 and sum of squares 16.｜中點條件給和2及平方和16。','y_1+y_2=2,§ y_1^2+y_2^2=16§Rightarrow y_1y_2=-6'],['The ordinates solve one quadratic.｜縱坐標滿足同一二次式。','y^2-2y-6=0§Rightarrow y=1§pm§sqrt7'],['Use x=y²/4 and match signs.｜用x=y²/4，並匹配符號。','(x,y)=(2§pm§sqrt7/2,1§pm§sqrt7),§ 2x-y=3']],'Chord line 2x−y=3; endpoints (2±√7/2,1±√7) with matching signs.｜弦線2x−y=3；端點(2±√7/2,1±√7)，符號相配。','The two ± signs are linked, not independent choices giving four points.｜兩個±符號相連，不是可獨立選成四點。'),
];
const intersectionsD=[
 D('diagnostic-zero-root','Choose all intersections of y²=4x and y=x.｜選出y²=4x及y=x的所有交點。','',['(4,4)','(0,0)','(0,0),(4,4)','(0,0),(4,-4)'],'C',[['A','Divided by x and lost zero.｜除以x而漏掉零。'],['B','Lost the nonzero factor root.｜漏掉非零因子的根。'],['D','Did not substitute back into the line.｜沒有代回直線。']],['Factor x(x−4)=0.｜分解x(x−4)=0。','Every point must satisfy both equations.｜每點須滿足兩方程。'],[['Retain both roots.｜保留兩根。','x=0,4'],['Use y=x for each.｜各自使用y=x。','(x,y)=(0,0),(4,4)']],'C.｜C。','An intersection is a solution of a system, not of just the eliminated equation.｜交點是聯立方程的解，不只是消元式的解。'),
 D('diagnostic-discriminant','After line substitution the equation is 0x²+2x−4=0. How many real intersections follow?｜代入直線後得0x²+2x−4=0，會有多少個實交點？','',['0','1','2','§infty'],'B',[['A','Treated zero leading coefficient as no solution.｜把首項零誤當無解。'],['C','Applied a quadratic discriminant to a linear equation.｜對一次方程使用二次判別式。'],['D','Confused a linear equation with an identity.｜把一次方程與恆等式混淆。']],['Identify the actual degree first.｜先辨認實際次數。','Solve 2x−4=0.｜解2x−4=0。'],[['The equation is linear.｜方程為一次。','x=2'],['A line gives one corresponding ordinate.｜直線給一個對應縱坐標。']],'B: one intersection; tangency does not follow from this alone.｜B：一個交點；單憑此不能推出相切。','The discriminant criterion requires a nonzero quadratic coefficient.｜判別式準則要求二次係數非零。'),
];

const specs=[
 {id:'vectors-geometric',key:'geometric',parents:['c2-6-1'],prerequisites:[],scope:['JM02'],title:'Vectors as displacements｜向量作為位移',
 summary:'Translate, add and scale arrows; distinguish a journey from its net displacement.｜平移、相加及數乘箭頭，分辨路程與淨位移。',
 objectives:['Represent a displacement independently of its starting point.｜不依賴起點表示位移。','Use head-to-tail addition and absolute scaling of lengths.｜使用首尾相接法及長度的絕對倍數。','Choose a velocity that meets a directional constraint.｜選擇符合方向限制的速度。'],
 concept:['Why an arrow can move｜箭頭為何可以搬動','A displacement records change in position. Translating both endpoints preserves that change; reversing them negates it.｜位移記錄位置變化；同時平移兩端點保留變化，交換兩端點則取相反向量。','§overrightarrow{AB}=B-A,§quad|t u|=|t||u|',
 'A route can contain many turns but its net displacement needs only the start and finish.｜路線可多次轉彎，淨位移卻只需起點與終點。',
 [['Intermediate positions cancel in a joined route.｜連接路線的中間位置相消。','(B-A)+(C-B)=C-A'],['Squaring a scaled length produces t², so its nonnegative square root is |t|.｜數乘長度平方含t²，取非負平方根便是|t|。','|tu|=§sqrt{t^2(u_x^2+u_y^2)}=|t||u|']],
 ['Normalize only a nonzero vector.｜只可把非零向量單位化。','Equal vectors have both the same direction and the same length.｜相等向量須同方向且同長度。'],
 'Two opposite unit arrows have resultant zero, although the sum of their lengths is two.｜兩枝反向單位箭頭的合向量為零，但模之和為二。',
 ['Drawn arrow → ordered components → net displacement → magnitude.｜箭頭圖→有序分量→淨位移→模。']],
 mistakes:['A minus sign changes direction, not the sign of a length.｜負號改變方向，不令長度變負。','Walking distance and displacement magnitude answer different questions.｜路程與位移的模回答不同問題。'],
 prompts:['If I slide this arrow to another desk, what changes?｜把箭頭平移到另一張桌，甚麼改變？','Can travelling farther leave you closer to your start?｜走得更遠，可否反而更接近起點？'],
 board:['Draw east 3, north 4 and the single diagonal; label distance 7 and displacement 5.｜畫向東3、向北4及單一斜線，標示路程7、位移5。','Display boat + current = ground velocity, then impose the zero horizontal component.｜寫出船速＋水流＝對地速度，再令水平分量為零。'],
 anticipated:['A student gives −6 as a scaled length. Ask them to locate a negative distance on a ruler.｜學生把數乘後長度寫−6，請他在尺上指出負長度。'],
 followups:['If the current is faster than the boat, can a due-north path still exist? Explain with a squared component.｜若水流比船快，還能正北航行嗎？用分量平方解釋。'],
 remediation:['Use two opposite paper arrows, then separately measure the two lengths and the zero resultant.｜用兩枝反向紙箭頭，分別量度其模及零合向量。'],
 exit:['State one quantity preserved by translating an arrow and one route property it does not encode.｜寫一項平移箭頭保留的量，及一項箭頭未記錄的路線特性。'],
 rubric:['Credit the chosen orientation, signed components and a nonnegative magnitude separately. Sample: (−3,4)+(3,0)=(0,4), so crossing time is 20/4.｜分別評核方向選擇、有符號分量及非負模。示例：(−3,4)＋(3,0)＝(0,4)，故過河時間20/4。'],
 activities:['Compare two translated arrows and vote on equality.｜比較兩枝平移箭頭並判斷是否相等。','Derive head-to-tail addition and negative scaling using a closed route.｜用封閉路線推導首尾相接及負數倍。','Work the translated-arrow example; pairs explain the length counterexample.｜完成平移箭頭例題，同桌解釋模的反例。','Solve the constrained river-crossing task and discuss when it fails.｜解有方向限制的渡河題，討論何時無解。','Write and check the exit statement about displacement.｜書寫並核對位移離堂題。'],
 inquiry:['Predict which features change when a vector is multiplied by a negative scalar.｜預測向量乘負數後，哪些特徵會改變。','The model plots u and tu from different starts; the table separates signed components from lengths.｜模型從不同起點畫u及tu，表格分開有符號分量與長度。','Choose controls producing zero displacement but a nonzero original vector; explain why unit direction then fails.｜設定使數乘後位移為零但原向量非零，解釋為何此時不能取單位方向。'],
 qs:geometric,ds:geometricD},
 {id:'vectors-coordinates',key:'coordinates',parents:['c2-6-3'],prerequisites:['vectors-geometric'],scope:['JM02'],title:'Coordinates, bases and division｜坐標、基底與分點',
 summary:'Convert arrows to coordinates, recover unknown endpoints and test when a basis actually determines coordinates.｜把箭頭化為坐標、還原未知端點，檢查基底能否唯一決定坐標。',
 objectives:['Subtract endpoints in the correct order.｜按正確次序相減端點。','Use affine weights for a midpoint, division point and centroid.｜用仿射權重求中點、分點及重心。','Distinguish an independent basis from parallel generating vectors.｜分辨獨立基底與平行生成向量。'],
 concept:['Coordinates require an origin and independent directions｜坐標需要原點及獨立方向','An arrow is endpoint minus start. Affine weights whose sum is one describe a point independently of a translated origin. Two parallel directions cannot give unique plane coordinates.｜向量是終點減起點；權重和為一的仿射組合不受原點平移影響。兩個平行方向不能唯一表示平面坐標。','P=(1-t)A+tB,§quad§det(e_1,e_2)§ne0',
 'Recovering a missing vertex from a centroid is an inverse problem, so the weights must be interpreted before arithmetic.｜由重心還原頂點是逆問題，須先理解權重才計算。',
 [['Point division follows from moving a fraction t of AB from A.｜從A走AB的t倍便得到分點。','P=A+t(B-A)'],['Independent columns give a unique solution for the coefficients.｜獨立列向量令係數解唯一。','ae_1+be_2=v']],
 ['Internal division requires 0<t<1.｜內分要求0<t<1。','A two-dimensional basis has nonzero determinant.｜平面基底的行列式須非零。'],
 'The pair (1,2),(2,4) spans only a line; (3,6) has infinitely many coefficient pairs.｜(1,2)、(2,4)只能生成一直線；(3,6)有無限多組係數。',
 ['Endpoint diagram ↔ displacement equation ↔ two simultaneous scalar equations.｜端點圖↔位移方程↔兩條聯立純量方程。']],
 mistakes:['AP:PB=2:1 places P two thirds of the way from A, not one third.｜AP:PB＝2:1，P在由A出發的三分之二處，不是三分之一。','Solving coordinates in a dependent pair may give infinitely many or no solutions.｜用相依向量求坐標，可能無限多解或無解。'],
 prompts:['Which subtraction gives an arrow pointing from A to B?｜哪一個相減次序給由A指向B的箭頭？','Why do the coefficients of a point division sum to one?｜為何分點的權重和為一？'],
 board:['Mark A, P, B on a number line before substituting into the division formula.｜代入分點公式前，先在數線標A、P、B。','Put the independent and dependent basis systems side by side and compare determinants.｜並排展示獨立及相依基底方程，比較行列式。'],
 anticipated:['Students reverse the ratio weights. Check whether the longer AP places P nearer B.｜學生把比例權重調轉；檢查較長AP是否令P靠近B。'],
 followups:['Translate every vertex by the same vector. How does the centroid move?｜把所有頂點平移同一向量，重心如何移動？'],
 remediation:['Use A=0 and B=9 to locate a 2:1 internal division before doing two coordinates.｜先用A＝0、B＝9定位2:1內分，再處理兩個坐標。'],
 exit:['Give a dependent pair and a vector that it cannot represent.｜給一對相依向量及一個它們無法表示的向量。'],
 rubric:['Require the endpoint order, correct affine weights and a uniqueness check where a basis is used. Sample: G=(A+B+C)/3 implies C=3G−A−B.｜要求端點次序、正確仿射權重及使用基底時的唯一性檢查。示例：G＝(A＋B＋C)/3，故C＝3G−A−B。'],
 activities:['Diagnose reversed endpoint subtraction.｜診斷端點相減次序錯誤。','Derive division and centroid expressions using displacements.｜用位移推導分點及重心式。','Solve one independent and one dependent basis system.｜各解一個獨立及相依基底方程。','Recover a triangle from its centroid and verify it is nondegenerate.｜由重心還原三角形，驗證它不退化。','Check a proposed basis counterexample.｜核對一個基底反例。'],
 inquiry:['Predict when the moving weighted point lies inside AB.｜預測移動分點何時在AB內。','P=A+t(B−A) works for internal and external division; only the interval for t changes.｜P＝A＋t(B−A)同時適用內分及外分，只是t的範圍不同。','Find a weight giving AP twice PB externally, then distinguish it from the internal solution.｜找出令AP為PB兩倍的外分權重，並與內分解區別。'],
 qs:coordinates,ds:coordinatesD},
 {id:'vectors-dot',key:'dot',parents:['c2-6-2'],prerequisites:['vectors-coordinates'],scope:['JM02'],title:'Dot products and constrained projection｜數量積與受限投影',
 summary:'Connect signed projection, angle and squared distance; distinguish a line projection from a nearest point on a segment.｜連結有向投影、夾角及距離平方，分辨直線投影與線段最近點。',
 objectives:['Interpret the sign of a dot product.｜解釋數量積的符號。','Expand squared vector norms correctly.｜正確展開向量模的平方。','Check zero vectors and segment endpoints before interpreting an angle or minimizer.｜解釋夾角或最小點前，檢查零向量及線段端點。'],
 concept:['Projection is an orthogonal decomposition｜投影是正交分解','Subtract a multiple of u from v so that the remainder has zero dot product with u. The resulting multiple is a projection coefficient, not a projected length.｜從v減去u的某倍數，使餘向量與u數量積為零；該倍數是投影係數，不是投影長度。','t=§frac{u§cdot v}{u§cdot u},§quad |v-tu|^2=|v|^2-2t(u§cdot v)+t^2|u|^2',
 'Closest-point questions become manageable by splitting motion into parallel and perpendicular components.｜把運動分成平行與垂直分量，便能處理最近點問題。',
 [['Force the residual to have zero dot product.｜令餘向量數量積為零。','u§cdot(v-tu)=0'],['Solve only when the direction vector is nonzero.｜只在方向向量非零時求解。','t=(u§cdot v)/|u|^2']],
 ['The angle formula requires two nonzero vectors.｜夾角公式要求兩向量非零。','For a segment A+t(B−A), restrict 0≤t≤1 and compare endpoints when needed.｜對線段A＋t(B−A)，須限制0≤t≤1，必要時比較端點。'],
 'A perpendicular foot at (3,0) is outside the segment from (0,0) to (2,0); the nearest segment point is (2,0).｜垂足(3,0)在線段(0,0)至(2,0)外；線段最近點是(2,0)。',
 ['Geometric shadow ↔ scalar coefficient ↔ completed square in t.｜幾何投影↔純量係數↔關於t的配方式。']],
 mistakes:['u·v is a scalar, whereas componentwise multiplication is not the dot-product answer.｜u·v是純量，逐分量乘積不是數量積答案。','Dot product zero is valid for a zero vector but does not assign it an angle.｜零向量的數量積可為零，但不能因此賦予夾角。'],
 prompts:['Why can work be negative even though distance is nonnegative?｜距離非負，功為何可以是負？','Does a perpendicular foot always lie on the segment?｜垂足是否總在線段上？'],
 board:['Keep coefficient t, signed projected length t|u| and vector tu in separate columns.｜把係數t、有向投影長t|u|及向量tu分三欄。','Sketch the external foot and highlight the admissible segment interval.｜畫線段外垂足，標明可行參數範圍。'],
 anticipated:['Students divide by |u| instead of |u|² when finding t. Ask for the vector tu and check its residual dot product.｜學生求t時除以|u|而非|u|²；請他寫tu並檢查餘向量數量積。'],
 followups:['How does changing the length of u without changing its direction alter t and tu?｜只改變u長度而不改方向，t及tu各如何改變？'],
 remediation:['Project (3,4) onto (2,0): label coefficient 1.5, projected length 3 and vector (3,0).｜把(3,4)投影到(2,0)，標係數1.5、投影長3及向量(3,0)。'],
 exit:['Name the two assumptions needed before interpreting a dot-product quotient as a cosine.｜列出把數量積商解釋為餘弦前所需的兩個非零條件。'],
 rubric:['Credit expansion, admissible parameter range and geometric interpretation independently. Sample: t=3/2 is outside [0,1], so the nearest segment point occurs at t=1.｜分別評核展開式、可行參數範圍及幾何解釋。示例：t＝3/2不在[0,1]，故線段最近點在t＝1。'],
 activities:['Compare positive, zero and negative work.｜比較正功、零功及負功。','Derive projection by making the residual dot product zero.｜由餘向量數量積為零推導投影。','Compute and distinguish projection coefficient and length.｜計算並分辨投影係數與長度。','Solve the nearest-segment problem and the endpoint-inclusive circle locus.｜解線段最近點及包含端點的圓軌跡。','Explain the zero-vector angle exception.｜解釋零向量夾角例外。'],
 inquiry:['Predict the sign of u·v as v crosses the perpendicular direction.｜預測v越過垂直方向時u·v的符號。','The residual v−tu has zero dot product with u; when v=0, projection is zero but its angle is undefined.｜餘向量v−tu與u數量積為零；v＝0時投影為零，但夾角未定義。','Choose v whose projection has negative coefficient and explain the direction of the projected vector.｜選擇投影係數為負的v，解釋投影向量方向。'],
 qs:dot,ds:dotD},
 {id:'vectors-proof-triangles',key:'triangles',parents:['c2-6-4'],prerequisites:['vectors-coordinates','vectors-dot'],scope:['JM02'],title:'Vector proofs in triangles｜三角形的向量證明',
 summary:'Turn geometric hypotheses into vector equations; prove midpoint, centroid and orthocenter properties with their assumptions visible.｜把幾何假設轉為向量方程，清楚列出条件地證明中點、重心及垂心性質。',
 objectives:['Choose a convenient origin without changing a geometric claim.｜選擇方便原點而不改變幾何命題。','Derive a median identity from a squared norm.｜由模平方推導中線公式。','Separate a theorem, its converse and nondegeneracy conditions.｜分清定理、逆命題及不退化條件。'],
 concept:['An origin turns a triangle into two vectors｜原點把三角形化成兩個向量','Set A as origin and write B=u,C=v. Midpoints become averages, side lengths become norms and perpendicularity becomes a zero dot product.｜取A為原點，寫B＝u、C＝v；中點成為平均、邊長成為模、垂直成為數量積零。','M=(u+v)/2,§quad G=(u+v)/3',
 'A proof should explain why every triangle with the assumptions works, rather than verify one drawing.｜證明須解釋所有符合假設的三角形為何成立，不只是驗證一幅圖。',
 [['For midpoints D=u/2 and E=v/2, subtract their positions.｜對中點D＝u/2、E＝v/2，相減其位置。','DE=(v-u)/2=BC/2'],['Expand a median norm and eliminate the dot product using the opposite side.｜展開中線模，利用對邊消去數量積。','4AM^2=2|u|^2+2|v|^2-|u-v|^2']],
 ['A triangle needs noncollinear vertices.｜三角形要求頂點不共線。','A rhombus converse here assumes a nondegenerate parallelogram.｜此處菱形逆命題假設平行四邊形不退化。'],
 'Perpendicular diagonals in an arbitrary quadrilateral do not force all four sides equal.｜任意四邊形的對角線垂直，不足以推出四邊等長。',
 ['Triangle sketch → two position vectors → scalar identity → geometric conclusion.｜三角形圖→兩位置向量→純量恆等式→幾何結論。']],
 mistakes:['A numerical example supports a conjecture but is not a proof for every triangle.｜數值例子可支持猜想，不能證明所有三角形。','A converse needs its own hypotheses and argument.｜逆命題須有自己的假設及論證。'],
 prompts:['Which origin makes two vertex positions simplest?｜哪個原點令兩個頂點位置最簡單？','Where exactly did the parallelogram assumption enter?｜平行四邊形假設在哪一步使用？'],
 board:['Arrange givens, vector translation, identity and conclusion in four lines.｜按已知、向量翻譯、恆等式、結論四行排列。','For the orthocenter, write one dot-product equation for each altitude and verify the third.｜求垂心時，逐條寫高線數量積方程，並驗證第三條。'],
 anticipated:['Students say the diagonals are perpendicular because their lengths match. Expand their dot product to reveal the actual side-length condition.｜學生因對角線等長便稱垂直；展開數量積以找出真正的邊長條件。'],
 followups:['Can the centroid formula still be evaluated for collinear points, and does it create a nondegenerate triangle?｜共線點仍可計算重心公式嗎？公式會令三角形變不退化嗎？'],
 remediation:['Start with the midpoint subtraction E−D before introducing a length formula.｜先做中點相減E−D，再引入長度公式。'],
 exit:['Write the missing hypothesis in “perpendicular diagonals imply a rhombus”.｜補出「對角線垂直推出菱形」缺少的假設。'],
 rubric:['Look for a justified origin, correct directed vectors and a return to the geometric claim. Sample: (u+v)·(u−v)=|u|²−|v|², so perpendicular diagonals force equal adjacent sides in a parallelogram.｜評核原點選擇、有向向量及回到幾何結論。示例：(u＋v)·(u−v)＝|u|²−|v|²，故平行四邊形對角線垂直推出鄰邊等長。'],
 activities:['Compare one numerical triangle with a universal claim.｜比較一個數值三角形與全稱命題。','Derive midpoint and median identities with A as origin.｜取A為原點，推導中點及中線恆等式。','Use dot products to verify right angles and an orthocenter.｜用數量積驗證直角及垂心。','Prove the rhombus converse and discuss the missing assumption.｜證明菱形逆命題並討論遺漏假設。','Repair a one-line proof with an unjustified conclusion.｜修正結論缺乏依據的一行證明。'],
 inquiry:['Predict whether the medians still meet as the third vertex crosses the baseline.｜預測第三頂點越過底邊時，中線是否仍相交。','The affine centroid identity remains true at collinearity, but triangle area becomes zero.｜共線時仿射重心恆等式仍成立，但三角形面積變零。','Choose a degenerate setting and explain which algebraic identities survive and which triangle statements lose their usual meaning.｜選擇退化設定，解釋哪些代數恆等式保留、哪些三角形敘述失去通常意義。'],
 qs:triangles,ds:trianglesD},
 {id:'conics-ellipse',key:'ellipse',parents:['s1-3-1'],prerequisites:[],scope:['JM01','JM02'],title:'Ellipse: definition, axes and constraints｜橢圓：定義、軸與限制',
 summary:'Build an ellipse from a distance sum, identify its major direction and distinguish a genuine ellipse from boundary loci.｜由距離和建立橢圓，辨認長軸方向，分辨真正橢圓與邊界軌跡。',
 objectives:['Relate the focal definition to a²=b²+c².｜連結焦點定義與a²＝b²＋c²。','Read translated and vertical ellipses without confusing denominators with lengths.｜閱讀平移及直長軸橢圓，不混淆分母與長度。','Use scaling to optimize a linear quantity and test locus feasibility.｜用縮放求線性量最值，並檢查軌跡可行性。'],
 concept:['A fixed sum is possible only above the focal separation｜定和須大於焦點距離','For foci (±c,0), a nondegenerate ellipse has distance sum 2a>2c. Its transverse semiaxis satisfies b²=a²−c².｜焦點(±c,0)的非退化橢圓，其距離和2a須大於2c；另一半軸滿足b²＝a²−c²。','x^2/a^2+y^2/b^2=1,§quad c^2=a^2-b^2',
 'The definition lets us reject impossible data before manipulating two square roots.｜定義讓我們在處理兩個根式前，先排除不可能的資料。',
 [['At a major vertex the focal distances add to 2a.｜長軸頂點的兩焦距和為2a。','(a-c)+(a+c)=2a'],['At a minor vertex each focal distance is a.｜短軸頂點的兩焦距各為a。','b^2+c^2=a^2']],
 ['Use a for the larger semiaxis when naming focal quantities.｜計算焦點量時，以a表示較大半軸。','Equal semiaxes give a circle; focal sum equal to separation gives a segment.｜兩半軸相等給圓；焦距和等於焦點距離給線段。'],
 'For foci separated by 6, a distance sum of 5 is impossible and a sum of 6 gives a segment, not a nondegenerate ellipse.｜焦點距離6時，距離和5不可能；距離和6給線段，不是非退化橢圓。',
 ['Distance-sum definition ↔ standard equation ↔ scaled unit circle.｜距離和定義↔標準方程↔縮放單位圓。']],
 mistakes:['The denominator 25 represents a squared semiaxis, so the semiaxis is 5.｜分母25是半軸平方，故半軸為5。','The larger denominator determines the major axis even when it belongs to y².｜較大分母決定長軸，即使它在y²之下。'],
 prompts:['What happens when the string length equals the distance between the pins?｜繩長恰等於兩釘距離時會怎樣？','Which direction has the largest intercept?｜哪個方向的截距最大？'],
 board:['Use three rows: sum below, equal to, and above the focal separation.｜分三行比較距離和小於、等於及大於焦點距離。','Scale x=2U,y=3V before bounding 3x+4y.｜先縮放x＝2U、y＝3V，再估計3x＋4y。'],
 anticipated:['Students always put foci on the x-axis. Ask them to mark the larger intercept first.｜學生總把焦點放x軸；請先標較大截距。'],
 followups:['Why must an equality case be checked after finding an upper bound?｜求得上界後，為何仍要檢查等號能否達到？'],
 remediation:['Draw semiaxes as actual lengths before calculating c².｜先把半軸畫成實際長度，再計算c²。'],
 exit:['Classify distance sums 5, 6 and 10 for foci at (±3,0).｜對焦點(±3,0)，分類距離和5、6及10的軌跡。'],
 rubric:['Credit axis identification, positive-length conditions and an attainable equality case. Sample: 6U+12V≤√180 with U²+V²=1; equality fixes the maximizing point.｜評核軸方向、正長度條件及可達等號。示例：U²＋V²＝1時，6U＋12V≤√180，等號決定最大值點。'],
 activities:['Predict the string-and-pins boundary cases.｜預測繩與釘的邊界情況。','Derive the relation between a,b,c from axis vertices.｜由軸上頂點推導a、b、c關係。','Read horizontal, vertical and translated equations.｜閱讀水平、垂直及平移方程。','Solve a scaled optimization and an impossible-locus test.｜解縮放最值及不可能軌跡判斷題。','Classify the focal-sum exit cases.｜完成焦距和分類離堂題。'],
 inquiry:['Predict which axis contains the foci when the two semiaxis controls exchange size.｜預測兩半軸大小交換時焦點落在哪一軸。','The focal separation is computed from the difference of squared semiaxes; a zero semiaxis is shown as a boundary segment.｜焦點距離由半軸平方差求得；半軸為零時顯示邊界線段。','Find the circular setting, then explain why its coincident foci still satisfy the distance-sum definition.｜找出圓的設定，解釋重合焦點為何仍符合距離和定義。'],
 qs:ellipse,ds:ellipseD},
 {id:'conics-hyperbola',key:'hyperbola',parents:['s1-3-2'],prerequisites:['conics-ellipse'],scope:['JM01','JM02'],title:'Hyperbola: branches and asymptotes｜雙曲線：分支與漸近線',
 summary:'Keep signed and absolute focal differences separate; inspect degree loss when a line is parallel to an asymptote.｜分清有符號及絕對焦距差；直線平行漸近線時檢查方程降次。',
 objectives:['Derive c²=a²+b² from the focal difference.｜由焦距差連結c²＝a²＋b²。','Identify branches, vertices and asymptotes in both orientations.｜辨認兩種方向的分支、頂點及漸近線。','Classify focal-difference boundary cases and one-intersection lines.｜分類焦距差邊界情況及單交點直線。'],
 concept:['Difference fixes two branches; sign selects one｜距離差絕對值定兩支，符號選一支','A nondegenerate hyperbola requires 0<2a<2c. An absolute difference gives two branches; assigning a sign distinguishes which focus is farther.｜非退化雙曲線要求0<2a<2c；絕對差給兩支，指定符號則分辨哪一焦點較遠。','x^2/a^2-y^2/b^2=1,§quad c^2=a^2+b^2,§quad y=§pm(b/a)x',
 'A line may meet a hyperbola once because a quadratic term cancels, so a one-point count alone cannot certify tangency.｜直線可因二次項相消而只與雙曲線交於一點，因此單交點不能單獨證明相切。',
 [['Rearrange the equation to compare large coordinate magnitudes.｜重排方程，比較大坐標的主導部分。','y^2=(b^2/a^2)x^2-b^2'],['The leading ratio approaches ±b/a, but substituting the asymptote exactly produces 0=1.｜主導比率趨近±b/a，但直接代入漸近線會得0＝1。','x^2/a^2-(bx/a)^2/b^2=0']],
 ['Both a and b must be positive for the displayed standard equation.｜所示標準方程要求a、b均為正。','Check the actual polynomial degree after line substitution.｜代入直線後，須檢查多項式的實際次數。'],
 'The line y=x+1 meets x²−y²=1 only at (−1,0), but the tangent there is x=−1.｜直線y＝x＋1只在(−1,0)與x²−y²＝1相交，但該處切線是x＝−1。',
 ['Focal difference ↔ signed branch ↔ standard equation ↔ asymptote slopes.｜焦距差↔有符號分支↔標準方程↔漸近線斜率。']],
 mistakes:['For a hyperbola c² is a sum, whereas for an ellipse it is a difference.｜雙曲線的c²是和；橢圓的是差。','An asymptote is not a component of a nondegenerate hyperbola.｜漸近線不是非退化雙曲線的一部分。'],
 prompts:['Which focus is farther on the right branch?｜右支上哪一焦點較遠？','Can a line have one intersection without being tangent?｜直線能否只有一交點卻不相切？'],
 board:['Tabulate absolute difference 0, between 0 and 2c, equal to 2c and greater than 2c.｜列表比較絕對差0、介乎0與2c、等於2c及大於2c。','Substitute y=x+k before mentioning any discriminant.｜先代入y＝x＋k，然後才考慮判別式。'],
 anticipated:['Students set the discriminant to zero even after the x² term disappears. Circle the actual leading coefficient first.｜二次項消失後學生仍令判別式零；先圈出實際首項係數。'],
 followups:['How does the unique intersection move as the parallel line offset tends to zero?｜平行線截距趨近零時，唯一交點如何移動？'],
 remediation:['Use the vertices to decide which signed focal difference is positive.｜用頂點判定哪個有符號焦距差為正。'],
 exit:['Give an equation of a one-intersection non-tangent line and explain the degree loss.｜寫一條只有一交點但不相切的直線，解釋方程降次。'],
 rubric:['Require branch sign, standard-form parameters and a separate tangency justification. Sample: substituting y=x+1 gives −2x−1=1, so x=−1; this linear equation alone does not imply tangency.｜要求分支符號、標準式參數及獨立的相切理由。示例：代入y＝x＋1得−2x−1＝1，故x＝−1；此一次式本身不能推出相切。'],
 activities:['Locate the sign of the focal difference at each vertex.｜在兩頂點判斷焦距差符號。','Derive and sketch asymptote slopes with horizontal and vertical axes.｜推導並畫水平及垂直方向的漸近線。','Calculate a point and test whether an asymptote intersects.｜計算曲線點並檢查漸近線是否相交。','Classify the offset-line and focal-difference boundary cases.｜分類平移直線及焦距差的邊界情況。','Explain why a single intersection is insufficient for tangency.｜解釋單交點為何不足以證明相切。'],
 inquiry:['Predict whether shifting an asymptote parallel to itself produces zero, one or two intersections.｜預測把漸近線平行移動會有零、一還是兩個交點。','Exact cancellation leaves a linear equation for nonzero offset and a contradiction at zero offset.｜非零截距時，精確相消留下線性方程；零截距時留下矛盾。','Explain why the intersection escapes the viewing window as the offset approaches zero.｜解釋截距趨近零時交點為何離開視窗。'],
 qs:hyperbola,ds:hyperbolaD},
 {id:'conics-parabola',key:'parabola',parents:['s1-3-3'],prerequisites:[],scope:['JM01','JM02'],title:'Parabola: focus and directrix｜拋物線：焦點與準線',
 summary:'Derive a parabola from equal distances, track orientation under translation and use the definition in a distance optimization.｜由等距推導拋物線，追蹤平移後方向，並用定義處理距離最值。',
 objectives:['Convert between y²=4ax and its focus/directrix.｜互換y²＝4ax與焦點、準線。','Retain the absolute distance to a line when deriving a translated equation.｜推導平移方程時保留點到直線的絕對距離。','Check attainability in a focal-distance inequality.｜檢查焦距不等式的等號可達性。'],
 concept:['Equal distances produce the quadratic relation｜等距產生二次關係','The locus of points equidistant from (a,0) and x=−a satisfies y²=4ax when a≠0. The sign of a controls orientation.｜與(a,0)及x＝−a等距的點，在a≠0時滿足y²＝4ax；a的符號決定開口方向。','§sqrt{(x-a)^2+y^2}=|x+a|§quad§Longrightarrow§quad y^2=4ax',
 'The defining distance often replaces a square root with a simple linear quantity on the curve.｜曲線上利用定義，往往可把根式距離換成簡單線性量。',
 [['Square two nonnegative distances.｜把兩個非負距離平方。','(x-a)^2+y^2=(x+a)^2'],['Cancel x² and a², retaining the sign in 4ax.｜相消x²及a²，保留4ax的符號。','y^2=4ax']],
 ['A nondegenerate parabola has a nonzero focal parameter.｜非退化拋物線的焦參數非零。','A vertex is not a center of half-turn symmetry.｜頂點不是半周旋轉的對稱中心。'],
 'For y²=8x, (2,4) lies on the curve but its half-turn about the vertex, (−2,−4), does not.｜對y²＝8x，(2,4)在曲線上，但繞頂點半周旋轉後的(−2,−4)不在曲線上。',
 ['Focus/directrix diagram ↔ equality of distances ↔ translated standard equation.｜焦點準線圖↔等距方程↔平移標準式。']],
 mistakes:['The coefficient of x is 4a, not the focus coordinate a.｜x的係數是4a，不是焦點坐標a。','An inequality bound is a minimum only after its equality conditions are met.｜不等式下界須滿足等號條件，才是最小值。'],
 prompts:['Why is distance to x=−a written with an absolute value?｜到x＝−a的距離為何須寫絕對值？','What changes if the focus is left of the vertex?｜焦點在頂點左方時，甚麼改變？'],
 board:['Label vertex, focus, directrix and focal chord on the same diagram.｜在同一圖標頂點、焦點、準線及焦弦。','Keep a separate line for the equality case in the distance optimization.｜距離最值題另用一行檢查等號。'],
 anticipated:['Students halve 8 instead of dividing it by 4 to locate the focus. Substitute the proposed focus into the defining geometry.｜學生把8除二而非除四定位焦點；請用定義幾何核查。'],
 followups:['What set remains when a=0, and why is it excluded from the nondegenerate definition?｜a＝0時剩甚麼集合？為何排除於非退化定義？'],
 remediation:['Compare the vertex-to-focus distance and the vertex-to-directrix distance before expanding squares.｜展開平方前，先比較頂點到焦點及到準線的距離。'],
 exit:['For y²=−8x, state both focus and directrix with their signs.｜對y²＝−8x，寫出含正負號的焦點及準線。'],
 rubric:['Credit parameter interpretation, valid squaring and attained equality. Sample: on y²=8x, PF=x+2; the proposed bound is reached at the vertex and nowhere else.｜評核參數理解、合法平方及等號可達性。示例：y²＝8x上PF＝x＋2；所求下界只在頂點達到。'],
 activities:['Diagnose the factor-of-four focus error.｜診斷焦點參數的四倍錯誤。','Derive the focus/directrix equation including absolute distance.｜包括絕對距離地推導焦點準線方程。','Read rotated and translated parabolas and their focal chords.｜閱讀轉向及平移拋物線及其焦弦。','Solve the distance minimization and analyze its equality set.｜解距離最值並分析等號集合。','Identify the a=0 boundary locus.｜辨認a＝0的邊界軌跡。'],
 inquiry:['Predict which side contains the curve when a changes sign.｜預測a變號時曲線在頂點哪一側。','The model computes focus distance and directrix distance at the same sampled point; a=0 is displayed as a degenerate line.｜模型在同一取樣點計算焦距及準線距離；a＝0時顯示退化直線。','Translate the vertex while keeping a fixed and explain which distances remain unchanged.｜固定a而平移頂點，解釋哪些距離不變。'],
 qs:parabola,ds:parabolaD},
 {id:'conics-intersections',key:'ellipse',parents:['s1-3-1','s1-3-2','s1-3-3'],prerequisites:['conics-ellipse','conics-hyperbola','conics-parabola'],scope:['JM01','JM02'],title:'Conic intersections, chords and inverse problems｜圓錐曲線交點、弦與逆問題',
 summary:'Solve line–conic systems with degree and domain checks; use Vieta for midpoint loci and reconstruct a chord from its midpoint.｜檢查次數及定義域後解直線曲線聯立式；用韋達求中點軌跡，由中點還原弦。',
 objectives:['Retain all roots and substitute them into the original system.｜保留所有根並代回原聯立式。','Use the discriminant only for an actual quadratic.｜只對真正二次方程使用判別式。','Use root sums and products without unnecessarily solving every endpoint.｜利用根和根積，避免不必要地逐一求端點。'],
 concept:['Elimination preserves a system only when its operations are reversible｜消元須注意可逆性','After substituting a line, inspect the degree before counting roots. For a genuine quadratic, Vieta provides the midpoint; a slope parametrization must restore vertical lines separately.｜代入直線後，先檢查次數再數根。真正二次式可用韋達求中點；斜率參數形式须另補垂直線。','Ax^2+Bx+C=0,§quad x_1+x_2=-B/A§quad(A§ne0)',
 'A midpoint question usually needs the sum of roots, while an inverse chord question may need both sum and product.｜中點題通常只需根和；逆向求弦題可能同時需要根和與根積。',
 [['Substitute y=mx+b in the ellipse equation.｜把y＝mx＋b代入橢圓方程。','(4+9m^2)x^2+18mbx+9b^2-36=0'],['For two intersections, average the roots without extracting them individually.｜有兩交點時，毋須逐一開根便可求平均。','x_M=-9mb/(4+9m^2)']],
 ['Do not divide by a variable without checking its zero case.｜除以變量前須檢查零情況。','Tangency via a discriminant assumes a nonzero quadratic coefficient.｜以判別式判相切，須假設二次係數非零。','A locus derivation needs both necessity and sufficiency, including omitted parameter cases.｜軌跡推導須有必要性及充分性，並補遺漏參數情況。'],
 'Dividing x²=4x by x loses the intersection at the origin.｜把x²＝4x除以x會漏掉原點交點。',
 ['System ↔ eliminated equation ↔ root relations ↔ chord geometry.｜聯立式↔消元方程↔根的關係↔弦的幾何。']],
 mistakes:['One real root after degree loss does not establish tangency.｜降次後有一實根，不能據此判相切。','A locus equation may include extra points or omit a vertical-case point.｜軌跡方程可能多出點，或漏掉垂直情況的一點。'],
 prompts:['What is the actual degree after substitution?｜代入後實際是幾次？','Can the midpoint be found without writing both radicals?｜不寫出兩個根式，能否求中點？'],
 board:['Place degree check before discriminant, then back-substitution after roots.｜把次數檢查寫在判別式之前，根後寫代回檢查。','For the midpoint locus, reserve a box for the vertical chord and the reverse parametrization.｜中點軌跡另留一格處理垂直弦及反向參數還原。'],
 anticipated:['Students prove only that chord midpoints satisfy an ellipse equation. Ask how an arbitrary point on that ellipse recovers a chord.｜學生只證弦中點滿足橢圓式；追問橢圓上任意點如何還原一條弦。'],
 followups:['Which datum determines the slope in the inverse-parabola chord problem?｜拋物線逆向弦題中，哪個資料決定斜率？'],
 remediation:['Factor x(x−4)=0 before any division; check each point in y=x.｜先分解x(x−4)＝0，不先除法；逐點代入y＝x。'],
 exit:['State the extra check needed before using Δ=0 as a tangency test.｜說出用Δ＝0判相切前須補的檢查。'],
 rubric:['Credit degree, full root retention, back-substitution and a two-way locus argument. Sample: finite m covers k>0; the vertical chord supplies (0,0), completing the midpoint locus.｜評核次數、完整保根、代回及雙向軌跡論證。示例：有限m涵蓋k>0；垂直弦補上(0,0)，完成中點軌跡。'],
 activities:['Find the lost zero root in a proposed solution.｜找出一份解答漏掉的零根。','Derive the ellipse-line quadratic and Vieta midpoint.｜推導橢圓直線二次式及韋達中點。','Classify secant, tangent, external and degree-loss cases.｜分類割線、切線、外離及降次情況。','Reconstruct a chord and prove the full midpoint locus including the vertical case.｜還原一條弦，並包括垂直情況地證明完整中點軌跡。','Write the degree condition beside the discriminant rule.｜在判別式準則旁寫出次數條件。'],
 inquiry:['Predict intersection count as the line intercept passes its tangent values.｜預測截距經過相切值時交點數如何改變。','The model reports the actual quadratic, discriminant and midpoint, and offers a separate vertical-line mode.｜模型列出實際二次式、判別式及中點，另提供垂直線模式。','Choose a secant and move it to tangency; explain why the two endpoints and their midpoint coincide at the boundary.｜選一割線並移至相切，解釋邊界上兩端點及中點為何重合。'],
 qs:intersections,ds:intersectionsD},
];

const samples={
 'vectors-geometric':['Correct: “The length is 6; the negative multiplier reverses the arrow.”｜正確作答：「長度是6；負倍數令箭頭反向。」','Incorrect: “The length is −6 because the multiplier is negative.”｜錯誤作答：「倍數是負，所以長度是−6。」'],
 'vectors-coordinates':['Correct: “P is two thirds of the way from A to B, so P=(6,4).”｜正確作答：「P在由A至B的三分之二處，所以P＝(6,4)。」','Incorrect: “AP:PB=2:1 means P=(A+2B)/2.”｜錯誤作答：「AP:PB＝2:1，所以P＝(A＋2B)/2。」'],
 'vectors-dot':['Correct: “The coefficient is 1.5, but the signed projection length is 3.”｜正確作答：「係數是1.5，但有向投影長度是3。」','Incorrect: “The projection coefficient and projection length are always the same.”｜錯誤作答：「投影係數與投影長度總相同。」'],
 'vectors-proof-triangles':['Correct: “The parallelogram assumption makes its diagonal vectors u+v and v−u.”｜正確作答：「平行四邊形假設令對角線向量為u＋v及v−u。」','Incorrect: “Every quadrilateral with perpendicular diagonals is a rhombus.”｜錯誤作答：「所有對角線垂直的四邊形都是菱形。」'],
 'conics-ellipse':['Correct: “The larger denominator is under y², so the foci lie on the y-axis.”｜正確作答：「較大分母在y²之下，所以焦點在y軸。」','Incorrect: “The denominator 25 means the semiaxis has length 25.”｜錯誤作答：「分母25表示半軸長25。」'],
 'conics-hyperbola':['Correct: “The quadratic coefficient cancels, so one intersection need not be tangency.”｜正確作答：「二次係數相消，所以一交點不一定是相切。」','Incorrect: “A line with exactly one intersection must be tangent.”｜錯誤作答：「直線只有一交點就一定相切。」'],
 'conics-parabola':['Correct: “4a=8, so the focus is (2,0) and directrix x=−2.”｜正確作答：「4a＝8，所以焦點是(2,0)，準線x＝−2。」','Incorrect: “The focus is (8,0) because the equation contains 8x.”｜錯誤作答：「方程有8x，所以焦點是(8,0)。」'],
 'conics-intersections':['Correct: “I keep x=0 when factoring x(x−4)=0, and then use y=x.”｜正確作答：「分解x(x−4)＝0時保留x＝0，再用y＝x。」','Incorrect: “Dividing by x gives x=4, so (4,4) is the only intersection.”｜錯誤作答：「除以x得x＝4，所以只有交點(4,4)。」'],
};
const makeSkill=s=>{
 const [title,body,formula,motivation,derivation,conditions,counterexample,representations]=s.concept;
 const source={...refs[s.key]};
 const isVectors=s.id.startsWith('vectors-');
 const decorate=(q,i,diagnostic=false)=>({...q,
  id:diagnostic?'diagnostic-'+s.id+'-'+(i+1):'skill-'+s.id+'-'+q.kind+'-'+(i+1),
  source:{type:'original',lessonId:s.id,reference:source},
  primarySkillIds:[s.id],skills:[s.id],
  examScopes:s.id==='vectors-proof-triangles'&&['triangle-area','included-angle-length','median-numerical','centroid-ratio','diagnostic-cosine'].includes(q.taskType)?['JM01','JM02']:[...s.scope],
  ...(q.kind==='written'||(q.kind==='example'&&typeof q.answer!=='number')?{rubric:[q.result,q.explanation]}:{}),
 });
 return {id:s.id,familyId:isVectors?'vectors':'conics',familyTitle:B(isVectors?'Vectors｜向量':'Conics｜圓錐曲線'),title:B(s.title),summary:B(s.summary),source,
  ...(s.id==='conics-intersections'?{sourceReferences:[refs.ellipse,refs.hyperbola,refs.parabola]}:{}),
  parentLessonIds:s.parents,prerequisites:s.prerequisites,examScopes:s.scope,status:'authored',
  objectives:s.objectives.map(B),
  concepts:[{title:B(title),body:B(body),formula:T(formula),motivation:B(motivation),derivation:derivation.map(([text,math])=>{const b=B(text);return S(b.en,b.zh,T(math));}),conditions:conditions.map(B),counterexample:B(counterexample),representations:representations.map(B)}],
  misconceptions:s.mistakes.map(B),questions:s.qs.map((q,i)=>decorate(q,i)),diagnostics:s.ds.map((q,i)=>decorate(q,i,true)),
  teacher:{timing:[5,8,10,12,5].map((minutes,i)=>({minutes,title:B(['Prediction and diagnosis｜預測與診斷','Concept derivation｜概念推導','Guided application｜引導應用','Transfer and explanation｜遷移與解釋','Exit evidence｜離堂證據'][i]),activity:B(s.activities[i])})),
   ...Object.fromEntries(['prompts','board','followups','remediation','exit'].map(k=>[k,s[k].map(B)])),
   anticipated:[...s.anticipated.map(B),...samples[s.id].map(B)],
   rubric:s.rubric.map(text=>({...B(text),sample:B(samples[s.id][0])}))},
  inquiry:{type:'skill',prediction:B(s.inquiry[0]),explanation:B(s.inquiry[1]),transfer:B(s.inquiry[2])},
 };
};
export const vectorConicSkills=specs.map(makeSkill);
